      "field": "Collected official specification facts and direct review context (not additional canonical claims)",
      "value": "모델명 | FUJIFILM X-E5\n렌즈마운트 | FUJIFILM X mount\n이미지 센서 | 23.5mm x 15.7mm (APS-C) X-Trans CMOS 5 HR with primary color filter\n유효 화소수 | 40.2 millions pixels\n동일모델의 출시년월 | 2025년 8월\nDimensions |124.9mm /72.9mm /39.1mm (최소33.0mm)\n무게 | 배터리 및 메모리카드 포함 Approx.445g / 제외 Approx.396g\n손떨림 보정 | Image sensor shift mechanism with 5-axis compensation\n보정효과 | Center 7.0 stops and Periphery 6.0 stops; based on CIPA2024; Pitch/Yaw/Roll; With XF35mmF1.4 R lens mounted.\nCH | Electronic shutter Approx.20fps (1.29x crop); native Electronic shutter Approx.13fps. Mechanical shutter Approx.8.0fps.\nPre-shot table | Header1.25 X Crop and some rows1.29x crop inconsistent; do not mix pre-shot with normal CH.\n뷰파인더 | EVF0.39inch /2.36milliondots /0.62x (50mm35mmequivalent,infinity,-1.0m-1)\nLCD |3.0inch Tilt-Type Touch Screen /1.04milliondots\n6.2K(16:9) |6240x3510 /29.97p,25p,24p,23.98p\n미디어 기록(SD) | H.265 Long GOP MOV /10bit / DIS unavailable (–), OFFcrop1.23x.\nExternal RAW table |6.2K6240x3512 /12bit, different output path frominternal6240x3510.\n4K general59.94p and FHD highspeed240p are different modes.\n저장매체 |SD/SDHC/SDXC UHS-I/UHS-II V90; does notprovephysicalslotcount.\nFilm Simulation and price excluded.",
      "unit": null
    }
